# Data Retention Schedule
**Version:** 2.1
**Owner:** Compliance Team
**Last updated:** January 2026
**Classification:** Internal

---

## Retention Periods by Data Class

| Data Class | Subcategory | Retention Period | Legal Basis | Delete Method | Owner | Notes |
|------------|-------------|-----------------|-------------|---------------|-------|-------|
| PII - Customer | Account identifiers | 7 years post account closure | Contract, Legal obligation | Secure deletion | Engineering | Subject to right-to-erasure requests |
| PII - Customer | Transaction records | 7 years from transaction date | Legal obligation (tax) | Secure deletion | Finance/Engineering | CCPA and GDPR compliant |
| PII - Customer | Support communications | 3 years from last interaction | Legitimate interest | Secure deletion | Customer Success | Review under GDPR Art. 6(1)(f) |
| PII - Customer | Marketing preferences | Until opt-out + 1 year | Consent | Secure deletion | Marketing | Opt-out triggers immediate pause |
| PII - Employee | Employment records | 7 years post termination | Legal obligation | Secure deletion | HR | Subject to local employment law |
| PII - Employee | Payroll data | 7 years | Legal obligation (tax) | Secure deletion | Finance/HR | |
| PII - Employee | Access logs (sensitive systems) | 3 years | Security, legal | Secure deletion | Security | |
| Transaction | Financial transactions | 7 years | Legal obligation (tax, SOX) | Archive then delete | Finance | |
| Transaction | Contract records | 10 years post contract end | Legal obligation | Archive | Legal | |
| Transaction | Purchase orders | 7 years | Legal obligation | Archive | Procurement | |
| Log | Application logs (non-PII) | 90 days hot, 1 year archive | Security, operations | Auto-purge | Engineering | Logs containing PII purge at 30 days |
| Log | Security event logs | 2 years | Security, compliance | Archive then delete | Security | SOC 2 requirement |
| Log | Audit logs (admin access) | 5 years | Compliance, legal | Archive | Security/Compliance | Immutable, no early deletion |
| Log | API access logs | 90 days | Operations | Auto-purge | Engineering | |
| Contract | Customer contracts | 10 years post expiry | Legal obligation | Archive then delete | Legal | |
| Contract | Vendor contracts | 7 years post expiry | Legal obligation | Archive then delete | Legal | |
| HR | Performance reviews | 5 years | Legitimate interest | Secure deletion | HR | |
| HR | Recruitment data (unsuccessful) | 1 year from decision | Consent | Secure deletion | HR | GDPR Art. 17 applies |
| HR | Background check results | Duration of employment + 1 year | Legal obligation | Secure deletion | HR | Local law variation applies |
| Backup | System backups (PII-containing) | 90 days | Operations | Encrypted overwrite | Engineering | Backup retention != PII retention |

## Enforcement Mechanism

Retention enforcement is automated via the Data Lifecycle Manager (DLM) service. Manual overrides require Compliance team approval. Exceptions for legal hold are tracked in the Legal Hold register.

## Review Schedule

This schedule is reviewed annually by Legal and Compliance. Changes require VP-level approval and documentation in the change log.
